因为当你要求购买某样东西时，你的机器人现在会显示带有照片、评分、价格和店铺的产品卡片。
Because when you ask for something that you want to buy, your bot now
shows product cards with photos, a rating, the price, and the store.

259
00:22:02,670 --> 00:22:05,668
这和你在 Amazon 等网站上的体验非常相似。
So it's a similar experience to what you would expect in a site like Amazon.

260
00:22:05,870 --> 00:22:12,996
你甚至可以直接从智能体那里点击「立即购买」按钮，之后你
的机器人基本上会帮你跟踪订单，并在发货或送达时通知你。
You even have a buy now button straight from the agent, where after that your
bot basically tracks the order for you and tells you when it ships or arrives.

261
00:22:13,326 --> 00:22:14,976
接下来是设置 One Password。
Next is setting up one password.

262
00:22:15,214 --> 00:22:21,296
所以如果你使用 OnePassword，我强烈推荐这个，
这个应用基本上是一个把所有密码存在一起的工具。
So if you use one password, which I highly recommend, this app is basically a tool that keeps all of your passwords in one place.

263
00:22:21,678 --> 00:22:23,684
而且 Grokbot 现在已经有了直接的集成。
And Grokbot now has direct integration to it.

264
00:22:23,950 --> 00:22:30,496
这样你的登录信息就可以留在你自己的 OnePassword 库里，这能让你更放心，
确保你的智能体永远不会看到你的密码。
So your logins can stay in your own one password vault, which just provides
you better assurance that your agents will never see your password.

265
00:22:30,734 --> 00:22:37,056
要设置这个，你只需要打开“连接应用”，就是我们之前连接 Gmail 的那个地方，
然后搜索 OnePassword 并点击添加。
And to set this up, all you do is open Connect Apps, the same place
we connected Gmail earlier, then search for OnePassword and click add.

266
00:22:37,390 --> 00:22:40,096
接下来是 Grokbot 现在可以帮你打个电话。
Next is that Grokbot can now make phone calls for you.

267
00:22:40,206 --> 00:22:43,076
因为现在的很多业务仍然是通过电话进行的。
Because a lot of today's business still happens via phone calls.

268
00:22:43,342 --> 00:22:48,324
如果你需要跟进订单或者询问特定业务的细节，这非常有用。
And it is quite useful if in case you need to follow an order or inquire about details of a particular business.

269
00:22:48,496 --> 00:22:53,456
不过要注意的是，截至录制这一刻，它目前仅在美国可用。
Now do note that as of the time of this recording, it is only available in the US at the moment.

270
00:22:53,742 --> 00:22:57,216
所以他们可能是在分步骤推出，因为这个功能可能会非常强大。
So they're probably rolling this out in steps because of how powerful it can be.

271
00:22:57,422 --> 00:23:04,256
老实说，一旦全面推出，他们可能会设置限制，否
则我们会有无数个智能体不停地给很多人打电话。
And to be honest, once this is fully rolled out, they probably will set limits
or else we'll have multiple agents just calling multiple people all the time.

272
00:23:04,496 --> 00:23:08,176
但目前，如果你在美国，你可以亲自试一下看看它对你是否有效。
But for now, if you're in the US, then you can try this out yourself to see if it works for you.

273
00:23:08,336 --> 00:23:10,736
接下来是确保不要跳过对齐步骤。
Next is making sure not to skip alignment.

274
00:23:10,862 --> 00:23:16,516
如果你要用机器人做真正的端到端项目，在执行大任务之前，你需要学会与你的机器人进行对齐。
If you do actual end-to-end projects with your bot, you need to learn to align with your bots before doing the big task.

275
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:21,540
基本上，这意味着你的机器人会在大任务开始前向你提问。
And basically, this just means that your bot asks you questions before that big job starts.

276
00:23:21,902 --> 00:23:31,136
这很有用，因为如果你只是针对一个大需求发送一个通用的提示词，
它给出的最终结果可能不符合要求，而且还会浪费你的使用额度。
This is useful because if you send just a generic prompt for a big ask, the final output that they will give you is possibly off spec
and they would end up just wasting your usage.

277
00:23:31,438 --> 00:23:34,496
我个人做法是使用一个叫“slash align”的技能。
What I do personally is I use this skill called slash align.

278
00:23:34,638 --> 00:23:38,256
我知道另一个流行的叫“Grill Me”，其实跟这个差不多。
And I know another popular one is called Grill Me, which is pretty much the same thing.

279
00:23:38,414 --> 00:23:49,216
但基本上我的这个技能会给我提供编号问题以及每个问题的建议，
这样我就能快速回复并做出选择，确保在它开始执行大任务之前，我们已经对齐了。
But basically for my skill, that just gives me numbered questions as well as recommendations on each one so that I can just quickly
respond and choose to make sure that we are aligned before it goes and fires off the big task.

280
00:23:49,422 --> 00:23:51,856
接下来是让你的 Grokbot 使用你自己的电脑。
Next is letting your Grokbot use your own computer.

281
00:23:52,078 --> 00:23:57,956
默认情况下，你的机器人是在云端的自己的电脑上工作的，
就是那个即使你笔记本电脑关机也能继续运行的电脑。
Now, by default, your bot does work on its own computer in the cloud, the one that keeps running even with your laptop closed.

282
00:23:58,190 --> 00:24:05,536
但你也可以让它在你自己的电脑上工作，使用你那里的所有文件，只要你的设备是开着的，
并且 GrokBot 在上面运行即可。
But you can also actually let it work on your own computer with all of the files that you have there,
as long as your device is open and GrokBot is running on it.

283
00:24:05,678 --> 00:24:11,136
如果你有表格、照片，或者基本上任何目前存在你电脑上的文件，这都很有用。
And this is useful if you have spreadsheets, photos, and basically any file that just lives on your computer right now.

284
00:24:11,374 --> 00:24:16,016
这样你就不用手动上传并发送给 Grokbot，你可以让它直接去获取这些东西。
That instead of you having to upload and send it to Grokbot, you can just have it fetch those things for you.

285
00:24:16,206 --> 00:24:27,940
如果你在使用 Cloud Code，这也很有用，因为你可以让 Grokbot 查看你的 Cloud 技能，
并识别出它可以导入到记忆中的技能，这样你就可以在 Grokbot 内部直接使用它们。
This is also useful if you are using Cloud Code, because what you can do is just have Grokbot look into your Cloud skills and identify
the ones that it can import in its memory so that you can use it from within Grokbot itself.

286
00:24:28,206 --> 00:24:34,176
要这样做，只需打开设置，然后进入“电脑”，你可以在
这里选择默认给 Grokbot 提供多少级别的访问权限。
To do this, just open settings, then computer, and you can choose in
here how much level of access you will give to your grokbot by default.

287
00:24:34,350 --> 00:24:37,828
接下来是设置 Cloud Code 或 Codex 桥接，取决于你使用的是哪一个。
Next is setting up a cloud code or codex bridge, depending on what you use.

288
00:24:38,126 --> 00:24:43,616
因为如果你使用 Cloud Code，例如，它可以把你的 Grokbot 任务通过 Webhook 流程传递过去。
Because if you use Cloud Code, for example, it can actually hand your Grokbot jobs through a webhook routine.

289
00:24:43,854 --> 00:24:53,296
所以如果你需要 Cloud 把任务交给 Grokbot，甚至把你的技能或者业务记忆和上下文从 Cloud
Code 导出到 Grokbot，那么这是一个很好的解决方案。
And so if you need Cloud to hand off tasks to Grokbot or even export your skills or pieces of your business memory and context from
Cloud Code into Grokbot, then this is a good solution to do.

290
00:24:53,456 --> 00:25:00,004
这也能有效地让 Cloud Code 利用你的机器人擅长的事情，比如，
无需任何设置或额外费用就能搜索 X。
This also effectively lets Cloud Code use what your bot is good at, such as, for example, searching X with no setup or extra fees.

291
00:25:00,336 --> 00:25:03,776
要开始，你只需使用屏幕上的提示词并发送给 Cloud Code。
To get started, you can just use the prompt on the screen and send that to Cloud Code.

292
00:25:03,886 --> 00:25:08,176
现在，为了更进一步，有一个更高级的概念，那就是「中心计算机」。
Now, a more advanced concept of this to take it to the next level is the concept of a central computer.

293
00:25:08,430 --> 00:25:16,416
因为我们之前提到的 Cloud Code 和 Grokbot 的配置，基本上
必须运行在一个需要一直开机的设备上，Cloud Code 才能运行。
Because with the Cloud Code and Grokbot setup we said earlier, that basically has to
run on a device that needs to stay on for Cloud Code to even run in the first place.

294
00:25:16,814 --> 00:25:23,680
所谓中心计算机，基本上就是一台始终开机的机器，所有的文件、技能，
甚至你的业务上下文和记忆都存在这里。
Now, a central computer is basically one always-on machine where all of your files, your skills,
and even your business context and memory live.

295
00:25:23,854 --> 00:25:27,040
然后你只需要让 Cloud Code 和 GrokBot 都连接到它上面。
And you just have Cloud Code and GrokBot both connect to it.

296
00:25:27,246 --> 00:25:32,080
要设置这个，你首先当然需要这台机器，它将是整个生态系统中的中心计算机。
Now, to set this up, you first of course need the machine, which is going to be the central computer in this whole ecosystem.

297
00:25:32,270 --> 00:25:36,720
你可以使用安装了 Grokbot 和 Cloud Code 的 Mac mini 或迷你电脑。
You can use a Mac mini or a mini PC with both Grokbot and Cloud Code installed.

298
00:25:36,910 --> 00:25:42,160
你也可以使用 VPS，也就是虚拟专用服务器，本质上就是你在云端租用的电脑。
You can also use a VPS for this, which is a virtual private server, essentially a computer that you rent in the cloud.

299
00:25:42,350 --> 00:25:44,560
但我通常建议，如果你懂行的话，就用本地机器。
But I would recommend that generally if you know what you're doing.

300
00:25:44,718 --> 00:25:52,804
因为显然，如果你有很多敏感文件，把它们放在云端的 VPS 上，
根据你使用的 VPS 供应商的不同，会增加这些文件的风险暴露。
Because obviously, if you have a lot of sensitive files, having them placed in the VPS in the cloud increases the risk exposure of
those files depending on the VPS provider that you use.

301
00:25:53,120 --> 00:25:57,280
这是一个比较大的话题，所以如果你想要专门的课程，请在下方留言。
Now, this is a bigger topic, so just comment down below if you want a whole lesson on it.

302
00:25:57,518 --> 00:25:58,880
接下来是维护待办事项列表。
Next is keeping a backlog.

303
00:25:59,246 --> 00:26:03,120
待办事项列表基本上就是一份你想在某个时间点完成的所有任务清单。
So a backlog is basically one list of every task that you want to get to at some point.

304
00:26:03,374 --> 00:26:12,320
在很多工具中，你可以按优先级对这些任务进行排序，还可以使
用看板，清晰地显示哪些是待办、哪些在进行中，哪些已经完成。
In a lot of tools, you can sort these tasks by priority, and you can also have a Kanban board,
which clearly shows to you which one is to do, which one is in progress, and which tasks are done.

305
00:26:12,526 --> 00:26:16,720
这很有用，因为在日常工作中，你可能有一些想留到下次处理的任务。
Now, this is useful because in your day-to-day work, you probably have tasks that you want to set aside for the next time.

306
00:26:16,814 --> 00:26:20,260
而聊天界面并不是处理这类事情的最佳用户体验。
And the chat interface is simply not the best UX for that purpose.

307
00:26:20,590 --> 00:26:23,600
所以看看你的日常工作，现在是否需要一个待办事项列表。
And so just see in your day-to-day work if you now need a backlog.

308
00:26:24,014 --> 00:26:28,640
现在有很多开箱即用的应用可以实现这个功能，比如 Linear，
你可以把它连接到你的 Grokbot 上。
Now there's multiple apps that do this out of the box, like Linear, for example, which you can connect to your Grokbot.

309
00:26:29,020 --> 00:26:35,040
Todoist 也是一个更简单的应用你可以使用，或者你甚
至可以创建一个作为待办事项列表的 Grokbot 页面。
Todoist is also a simpler app that you can use, or you can even create a Grokbot page that functions as your backlog.

310
00:26:35,342 --> 00:26:38,000
你可以使用屏幕上显示的这个提示词来开始。
And you can get started with that with a prompt like this that you see on the screen.

311
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:40,160
接下来是机器人成绩单的概念。
Next is the concept of a bot report card.

312
00:26:40,430 --> 00:26:47,332
机器人成绩单基本上就是每周检查一次，由一个机器人给你的其他机器人打分（满分 10 分），
并建议如何改进表现较弱的机器人。
A bot report card is basically a weekly check where one bot scores your other bots out of 10 and suggests how to fix the weak ones.

313
00:26:47,598 --> 00:26:56,160
你可以把这个任务交给之前提到的 Dr. Eggbot，这很有用，因为一旦你有几个机器人，
就很难判断哪一个在偷懒，或者哪一个在消耗你的额度。
You can give this task to Dr. Eggbot from earlier, and this is useful because once you have a few bots,
it actually gets hard to tell which one keeps slipping and which one is draining your usage.

314
00:26:56,334 --> 00:27:01,220
所以再次强调，这是「像管理者一样思考」并思考如何最好管理你的智能体的一部分。
So again, this is part of the concept of thinking like a manager and seeing how you can best manage your agents.

315
00:27:01,518 --> 00:27:03,940
这有点像是你其他机器人的人力资源部门。
And so this is sort of like an HR for your other bots.

316
00:27:04,110 --> 00:27:10,148
要做到这一点，你只需要打开你想指定为 HR 的那个机器人，
并用类似这样的提示词要求它执行一个简单的常规任务。
And to do it, all you do is open that bot that you want to assign as HR and ask for a simple routine with a prompt like this.

317
00:27:10,510 --> 00:27:12,400
接下来是把机器人作为模板分享。
Next is sharing bots as a template.

318
00:27:12,526 --> 00:27:19,012
现在你可以把任何机器人变成模板，实际上就是其
他用户可以通过一个链接直接添加的机器人版本。
Now you can turn any bot into a template, actually, which is basically
a version of that bot that other people can add from simply a link.

319
00:27:19,310 --> 00:27:25,156
随它一起传输的只是机器人的名称、描述、技能和常规
任务，但绝不会包含你的电脑、登录信息或敏感文件。
What travels with it though is just the bot's name, description, skills,
and routines, but never your computer, your logins, or your sensitive files.

320
00:27:25,454 --> 00:27:31,268
要这样做，只需点击聊天顶部的机器人名称，选择
分享，然后选择创建副本，它就会给你那个链接。
To do this, just click the bot's name at the top of the chat and choose share and choose create a copy, which gives you that link.

321
00:27:31,630 --> 00:27:33,280
最后是机器人市场。
And lastly is the bot marketplace.

322
00:27:33,550 --> 00:27:40,356
所以，如果说模板是分享你自己的机器人的方式，那么 x.ai
上的官方机器人市场就是存放其他人制作的机器人的地方。
So if templates are how you share your own bots, the bot marketplace, the official one on x.ai,
is the place for bots that other people build.

323
00:27:40,494 --> 00:27:44,580
它有销售和营销等类别，还有 Grokbot 团队自己提供的板块。
It has categories like sales and marketing and a section from the grokbot team themselves.

324
00:27:44,974 --> 00:27:52,740
现在，给个专业建议：把这个链接发给你的主智能
体，直接让它推荐里面任何适用于你业务的模板。
Now, a pro tip is to send this link to your main agent and just ask that main agent
to recommend any templates in there that would be applicable to your business.

325
00:27:53,166 --> 00:27:53,600
就这样。
So there you go.

326
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:56,080
以上就是关于 Grokbot 的所有技巧和窍门。
That is all tips and techniques for Grokbot.

327
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:57,680
和往常一样，感谢看到最后。
And as usual, thanks for watching till the end.

328
00:27:57,760 --> 00:28:02,160
我通常会做这类视频，目的是帮助你更好地在业务中使用这些智能体。
I usually do videos like these where the intention is to help you use these agents better for your business.

329
00:28:02,320 --> 00:28:04,640
